 32; Thren. 3, 27-28","note":"Stellenangabe im Apparat der Ausgabe (Seite; Absatz ungefähr)"},{"id":"64521f6f0063","v":"csel.ambrosius.in_psalmum_118","w":"ambrosius.in_psalmum_118","a":"ambrosius_von_mailand","s":22,"p":[10,10],"r":[7,12],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Os. 7,12; Ps. 6, 2; Hier. 10, 24; Sap. 7,17; Ps. 93,10","note":"Stellenangabe im Apparat der Ausgabe (Seite; Absatz ungefähr)"},{"id":"8262969392af","v":"csel.ambrosius.in_psalmum_118","w":"ambrosius.in_psalmum_118","a":"ambrosius_von_mailand","s":29,"p":[8,8],"r":[10,12],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Os. 10, 12","note":"Stellenangabe im Apparat der Ausgabe (Seite; Absatz ungefähr)"},{"id":"46cbf9a3d236","v":"npnf.augustinus.confessiones","w":"augustinus.confessiones","a":"augustinus_von_hippo","s":7,"p":[24,24],"r":[2,10],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Hosea ii. 8.","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, umgerechnet)"},{"id":"871de0b6c549","v":"npnf.augustinus.confessiones","w":"augustinus.confessiones","a":"augustinus_von_hippo","s":8,"p":[16,16],"r":[5,11],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"\"Satan makes choice of persons of place and power . These are either in the Commonwealth or church. If he can, he will secure the throne and the pulpit, as the two forts that command the whole line....A prince or a ruler may stand for a thousand; therefore saith Paul to Elymas when he would have turned the deputy from the faith, `O full of all subtilty, thou child of the devil! 0'(Acts. xiii. 10). As if he had said, `You have learned this of your father the devil,-to haunt the courts of princes, wind into the favour of great ones. There is a double policy Satan hath in gaining such to his side.-( a ) None have such advantage to draw others to their way. Corrupt the captain, and it is hard it he bring not off his troop with him. When the princes-men of renown in their tribes-stood up with Korah, presently a multitude are drawn into the conspiracy (Num. xvi. 2, 19). Let Jeroboam set up idolatry, and Israel is soon in a snare. It is said [that] the people willingly walked after his commandment (Hos. v. 11). (b) Should the sin stay at court, and the infection go no further, yet the sin of such a one, though a good man, may cost a whole kingdom dear. Satan stood up against Israel, and provoked David to number Israel (1 Chron. xxi. 1). He owed Israel a spite, and he pays them home in their king's sin, which dropped in a fearful plague upon their heads,\"-Gurhall, The Christian in Complete Armour , vol. i. part 2."},{"id":"466479f3eedb","v":"npnf.augustinus.de_civitate_dei","w":"augustinus.de_civitate_dei","a":"augustinus_von_hippo","s":272,"p":[0,0],"r":[6,6],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Hos. vi. 6."},{"id":"b15bf66b4885","v":"npnf.augustinus.de_civitate_dei","w":"augustinus.de_civitate_dei","a":"augustinus_von_hippo","s":491,"p":[0,0],"r":[1,1],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Hos. i. 1."},{"id":"18140d8b3eb8","v":"npnf.augustinus.de_civitate_dei","w":"augustinus.de_civitate_dei","a":"augustinus_von_hippo","s":492,"p":[0,0],"r":[2,1],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Hos. i. 10.","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, umgerechnet)"},{"id":"e34550011d73","v":"npnf.augustinus.de_civitate_dei","w":"augustinus.de_civitate_dei","a":"augustinus_von_hippo","s":492,"p":[0,0],"r":[2,2],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Hos. i. 11.","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, umgerechnet)"},{"id":"a66d0907bab2","v":"npnf.augustinus.de_civitate_dei","w":"augustinus.de_civitate_dei","a":"augustinus_von_hippo","s":492,"p":[0,0],"r":[3,4],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Hos. iii. 4."},{"id":"a14e3c375a13","v":"npnf.augustinus.de_civitate_dei","w":"augustinus.de_civitate_dei","a":"augustinus_von_hippo","s":492,"p